{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21978","headline":"寄隐者 · 白居易","name":"寄隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卖药向都城，行憩青门树。\n道逢驰驿者，色有非常惧。\n亲族走相送，欲别不敢住。\n私怪问道旁，何人复何故。\n云是右丞相，当国握枢务。\n禄厚食万钱，恩深日三顾。\n昨日延英对，今日崖州去。\n由来君臣间，宠辱在朝暮。\n青青东郊草，中有归山路。\n归去卧云人，谋身计非误。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}